{"v":4,"catch":"如果您喜歡賽車遊戲並在美妙、快節奏的賽車體驗中測試您的技能，請立即查看 Animal Drifters。","desc":"575 / 5 000\nWyniki tłumaczenia\nstar_border\nAnimal Drifters 是一款精彩的街機遊戲，您的重點很簡單，您需要駕駛您的卡丁車並在所有其他人之前到達關卡的盡頭。 但是一路上有很多獎金和大量硬幣供您搶購。 最重要的是，您還將遇到許多需要避免的障礙。\n\n這讓Animal Drifters 極具吸引力，樂趣無窮，而且你最終總會有新的目標去追求。\n\n特徵：\n從許多不同的驅動程序中選擇\n賽車地圖上散佈著許多能量提升\n在遊戲中完成目標\n重播價值大","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2022-09-15","genres":["街機","競速"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1e70cf5f1de9e480281351170025de2442a25ffeb490b6f24b2f301d856f13fb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1f6cdf885b2173ff7b3e2208191c74df0793d3ebc8038addd094a5f4073e9aae.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/347a5db0db5033b6fa32157e0e791404fb995c25a165c982d48df29aa28f4678.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/22627e213b3e59f9de9db72369e9b922c67085479a53b5c74e6942a34180fc61.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/421155dc35114d14f2b9087f5639c367f1b9aad4d7ef88eabdc1348e6a657ca5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/458ee560ac892e0ef6b396b84be304b5e7f66a32a6d0fe777e61bc7e8dcd27bb.jpg"],"titleId":"010057f0195de000","dlc":[]}